# Lychee link-checker ignore file.
#
# Each line is a glob pattern; any URL whose host OR path matches is
# skipped silently. Comments start with `#`.
#
# Run with `--exclude-file .lycheeignore` (the validation workflow
# and `scripts/validate-local.sh` both pass it). `--offline` keeps
# the check runnable without network access — the cost is that
# live-link checking happens in CI only.

# Local anchors within a Markdown page. Lychee reports them as
# "connection refused" because there is no host to connect to.
**/*.md#*

# Anchor-only URLs that are common in long docs.
#anchor-only

# CI artifacts and SvelteKit-generated output never carry user-visible
# links.
**/coverage/**
**/.svelte-kit/**
**/build/**
**/dist/**
**/.wrangler/**
**/lcov-report/**
**/node_modules/**

# The `docs/` site occasionally links to in-repo source files by
# relative path that resolves only when the docs site is served —
# skip the offline ones that aren't reachable from disk.
**/*.md#h-*

# `127.0.0.1`, `localhost`, and `::1` are never reachable from CI
# anyway; Lychee's default offline run flags every occurrence.
localhost
127.0.0.1
::1
0.0.0.0
